# Store LF in the repository no matter which OS checks the files out.
#
# The app is developed on Windows and deployed on Linux, and without this rule
# Git rewrites the working copy to CRLF while the repository keeps LF. That
# mismatch shows up as a change in every file on every diff, which buries the
# real changes and makes review tooling report work that nobody did.
* text=auto eol=lf
